/T (The next morning, Jo arrived at school earlier than usual. Arjun noticed immediately. "You've never voluntarily arrived this early." Jo adjusted his bag. "I woke up early." "At six-thirty?" "Yes." "Without an alarm?" Jo hesitated. "...Maybe." Daniel looked at Kiran. "This is serious." Kiran smiled. "Very." Jo ignored them and glanced toward the corridor. She wasn't there. The first bell rang. Still nothing. He told himself it didn't matter. He opened his notebook and tried to concentrate on the lesson. Five minutes later, he looked at the door again. Arjun caught him. "You're not subtle." "I'm waiting for the teacher." "The teacher has been here for ten minutes." Jo looked down at his notebook. "Right.")
