/T (Eventually, Jo learned her name. It wasn't through some dramatic confession or secret investigation. It happened during a completely ordinary afternoon. She was standing near the notice board with two of her classmates when someone called out to her. "Hey, Ananya!" Jo heard it from across the corridor. He looked up immediately. Ananya. He repeated the name silently. Once. Twice. As though he needed to make sure he wouldn't forget it. Daniel appeared beside him. "So?" Jo smiled. "I know her name." Daniel grinned. "Congratulations." "For what?" "You've completed Level One." "What's Level Two?" "Talking to her." Jo's smile disappeared. "Let's not get ahead of ourselves.")
