/T (The rehearsal went better than Jo expected. By the time he stepped into the corridor, most of his nervousness had disappeared. He packed his guitar and started walking toward the courtyard. Then he saw her. Ananya was standing near the library with two of her classmates, laughing about something. Jo slowed down. He could have kept walking. Instead, he remembered what his friends had told him. Just say hello. Ananya looked up. Their eyes met. Jo took a breath. "Hi." She smiled. "Hi." That was it. She turned back toward her friends, and Jo continued walking. He had imagined their first conversation a hundred different ways. None of them had been this simple. Somehow, he liked it better that way. At the end of the corridor, Daniel was waiting. He looked at Jo and grinned. "Level Two." Jo laughed. "Don't start.")
