/T (The years that followed taught Jo something he hadn't expected. A crush could make your heart race. A song could make you believe you had found something special. But sometimes, feelings simply faded. Ananya eventually became a good friend, then a familiar face, and finally a memory he would look back on with a smile. There was no heartbreak. No bitterness. Just life moving forward. By the time their final school year arrived, Jo had stopped searching for signs that love was waiting around every corner. He still dreamed about it, of course. He still imagined the day he would meet someone who felt like home. But now, he understood that wanting something and finding it were two very different things. And before he could find out where love was waiting for him... there was another chapter of his life waiting first. Bengaluru.)
