1292 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /H1
/P 778 0 R
/T (Somewhere along the way, Jo had stopped searching for the perfect love story. He had learned that love wasn't always found in grand moments. Sometimes, it was a girl walking into a crowded room. Sometimes, it was a staircase accident. Sometimes, it was a little diary passed between two people who were learning how to understand each other. Sometimes, it was a chocolate given without a reason. Sometimes, it was sitting together in church on an ordinary Sunday. And sometimes, love was simply staying. Listening. Learning. Choosing. Jo looked at Mouna one last time and smiled. He had spent years searching for someone who would understand his words. Instead, life had given him someone who understood his silence. And perhaps that was the greatest love story of all. THE END)
/E (Somewhere along the way, Jo had stopped searching for the perfect love story. He had learned that love wasn't always found in grand moments. Sometimes, it was a girl walking into a crowded room. Sometimes, it was a staircase accident. Sometimes, it was a little diary passed between two people who were learning how to understand each other. Sometimes, it was a chocolate given without a reason. Sometimes, it was sitting together in church on an ordinary Sunday. And sometimes, love was simply staying. Listening. Learning. Choosing. Jo looked at Mouna one last time and smiled. He had spent years searching for someone who would understand his words. Instead, life had given him someone who understood his silence. And perhaps that was the greatest love story of all. THE END)
