1647 0 obj
<<
/Title (It was late that night when Jo woke up. The room was quiet. Mouna was asleep beside him. He looked at the clock. 2:17 A.M. For some reason, the time made him smile. He remembered another night, years ago. A younger Jo. A guitar. A quiet prayer. A boy asking God to help him find someone who would understand him. He looked at Mouna. She stirred slightly in her sleep. Jo smiled and whispered, "Thank you." He didn't know whether he was thanking God, life, or the girl sleeping beside him. Maybe all three. He closed his eyes. For once, there was nothing left to search for.)
/Dest [157 0 R /Fit]
/Parent 7 0 R
/Prev 1974 0 R
/Next 1295 0 R
>>
