/Title (She finally appeared during the second break. Jo was sitting beneath the rain tree with his friends when she crossed the courtyard. Daniel noticed her first. He nudged Jo. Jo looked up. Their eyes met. For just a moment, everything else seemed to disappear. Then she smiled. Jo smiled back. She continued walking. That was it. No conversation. No introduction. Nothing that would have meant anything to anyone else. But Jo couldn't stop smiling. Arjun leaned against the tree. "You're gone." "I'm not." "You smiled at a girl." "People smile." "Not like that." Daniel laughed. Jo shook his head. "You both are impossible." Maybe they were. But somewhere between that first glance and that tiny smile, something had begun. Jo just didn't know what to call it yet.)
